__ctuca__ |~np~ x1 teaches to x2 ideas x3 about subject x4 by method x5 ~/np~|~np~ x1 teaches audience x2 ideas/methods/lore x3 (du'u) about subject(s) x4 by method x5 (event). ~/np~
__cukla__ |~np~ x1 is round ~/np~|~np~ x1 is round/circular [2-dimensional shape/form]; x1 is a disk/circle/ring. ~/np~
__cukta__ |~np~ x1 is a book entitled x2 written by x3 for audience x4 in medium x5 ~/np~|~np~ x1 is a book containing work x2 by author x3 for audience x4 preserved in medium x5. ~/np~
__culno__ |~np~ x1 is full of x2 ~/np~|~np~ x1 is full/completely filled with x2. ~/np~
__cumki__ |~np~ x1 is possible under conditions x2 ~/np~|~np~ x1 (event/state/property) is possible under conditions x2; x1 may/might occur; x1 is a maybe. ~/np~
__cumla__ |~np~ x1 is humble about x2 ~/np~|~np~ x1 is humble/modest about x2 (abstraction); x1 displays humility about x2. ~/np~
__cunmi__ |~np~ x1 is millet of species x2 ~/np~|~np~ x1 is a quantity of millet [grain] of species/strain x2. ~/np~
__cunso__ |~np~ x1 is random under conditions x2 with probability distribution x3 ~/np~|~np~ x1 is random/fortuitous/unpredictable under conditions x2, with probability distribution x3. ~/np~
__cuntu__ |~np~ x1 is a business involving persons x_2 ~/np~|~np~ x1 is an affair/organized activity involving person(s) x2 (ind./mass); x1 is x2's business. ~/np~
__cupra__ |~np~ x1 produces x2 by process x3 ~/np~|~np~ x1 produces x2 [product] by process x3. ~/np~
__curmi__ |~np~ x1 permits x2 under conditions x3 ~/np~|~np~ x1 (agent) lets/permits/allows x2 (event) under conditions x3; x1 grants privilege x2. ~/np~
__curnu__ |~np~ x1 is a worm of species x2 ~/np~|~np~ x1 is a worm/invertebrate animal of species/breed x2. ~/np~
__curve__ |~np~ x1 is pure in property x2 ~/np~|~np~ x1 is pure/unadulterated/unmitigated/simple in property x2 (ka). ~/np~
__cusku__ |~np~ x1 says x2 to x3 via x4 ~/np~|~np~ x1 (agent) expresses/says x2 (sedu'u/text/lu'e concept) for audience x3 via expressive medium x4. ~/np~
__cutci__ |~np~ x1 is a shoe for covering x2 of material x3 ~/np~|~np~ x1 is a shoe/boot/sandal for covering/protecting [feet/hooves] x2, and of material x3. ~/np~
__cutne__ |~np~ x1 is the chest of x2 ~/np~|~np~ x1 is a/the chest/thorax/upper trunk/[rib cage/breast] [body-part] of x2. ~/np~
__cuxna__ |~np~ x1 chooses x2 from set x3 ~/np~|~np~ x1 chooses/selects x2 [choice] from set/sequence of alternatives x3 (complete set). ~/np~||